  "notes": "KvK PLAN (do on KvK gear days for points) — saved 2026-09-24\n• Governor Gear: Infantry 1 Gold 0★ → Gold 1★ — 23,000 Satin · 230 Threads · 40 Vision = 225,000 KvK points (+2.5% Infantry Attack/Defense, +61,200 power). Leaves 9,577 Satin · 27 Threads · 438 Vision; Gilded Threads are the bottleneck (next Gold 0★ → 1★ needs 230).\n• Hero Gear (Early Game Combat plan): Infantry Chest Mastery 11→12, Archer Helm Mastery 11→12, Cavalry Helm Mastery 10→11 (350 Forgehammers · 5 Mythic Gear); Archer Chest Lv 80→93 and Archer Gloves Lv 80→91 — DONE 2026-09-24. Skip the Cavalry Gloves reforge / Chest +1 swap (costs 50 XP, no gain).\n• T11 Archers: unlock needs 2,236 Dust (have 1,776 → 460 short) + 1M Gold (covered). Unlock research is ~91 days base time — start it before KvK and use Research/General speedups on the KvK research day for points. Then promote as many T10 Archers to T11 as possible (each ~+27 power: 126 vs 99).",
